        {
          "text": "E’yo ’disi Yehova ’yo ’dini: Emi erini e’yo mani ku, e’yo trutani azizu, emi dria alu alu emi adripi tia, emi alu alu emi agyi tia; emi ne, ma azi e’yo trutani emi tia, Yehova ’yo ra, emi truzu fezu sei pi dri, azo muani pie, liki pie. Ma nga fe emi ma ovu o’bezaru ’dale azini ’dole suru nyakua ’diyi ma eselia dria. ",
